# Use scalable SVG tray icons instead of 512x512 PNG bitmaps.
#
# The tray sent IconPixmap with a 512 px PNG that the panel scaled down to its
# own icon size, so the ROG mark was blurry at 22 px and on HiDPI panels. It
# now reports IconName and the panel renders the installed SVG itself. The
# three icons keep the GPU state colors (blue suspended, red active/mux,
# white dGPU disabled); they are not "-symbolic", so the theme does not
# recolor them. The files are installed by the template from files/icons/.
#
# The dependency on `image` is dropped: it existed only to decode the PNGs.
# Upstream status at 5346e18 (2026-11-17): the tray still uses PNG bitmaps.

--- a/rog-control-center/src/tray.rs
+++ b/rog-control-center/src/tray.rs
