 //! dGPU status monitor in `notify.rs` (the same source as the
 //! "dGPU status changed" notifications).
+//!
+//! The icons are installed as scalable SVGs and referenced by name, so the
+//! panel renders them at its own size and scale factor instead of scaling a
+//! bitmap down from 512 px.
 
